---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/home-v3.css';
---

<Layout
  title="M221Tech | Local data, useful products"
  description="Explore M221Tech products across football, nutrition, open data and experimental local-data work."
>
  <div class="m221-home-v3">
    <section class="m221-v3-hero">
      <div class="m221-container m221-v3-hero-inner">
        <div class="m221-v3-hero-main">
          <div>
            <span class="m221-kicker">Local data. Useful products.</span>
            <h1>Data products made to be used.</h1>
            <p class="m221-v3-lead">Football, food and local knowledge — structured into products you can explore, query and come back to.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="m221-v3-hero-actions">
            <a class="m221-btn m221-btn-primary" href="#products">Explore products</a>
            <a class="m221-btn m221-btn-secondary" href="/open/">Open data</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="m221-v3-action-rail" aria-label="Quick access to M221Tech products">
          <a class="m221-v3-action m221-v3-action-sports" href="https://sports.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="m221-v3-action-arrow">↗</span><small>Football</small><strong>M221Foot</strong><span>Competition · club · match</span></a>
          <a class="m221-v3-action m221-v3-action-wc" href="https://wc2026.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="m221-v3-action-arrow">↗</span><small>World Cup</small><strong>WC2026</strong><span>Event product</span></a>
          <a class="m221-v3-action m221-v3-action-food" href="https://lekkantu.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="m221-v3-action-arrow">↗</span><small>Nutrition</small><strong>Lekkantu</strong><span>Products · ingredients · nutrition</span></a>
          <a class="m221-v3-action m221-v3-action-open" href="/open/"><span class="m221-v3-action-arrow">→</span><small>Shared</small><strong>Open Data</strong><span>Datasets & reports</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="m221-v3-section" id="products">
      <div class="m221-container">
        <div class="m221-v3-section-head">
          <div><span class="m221-v3-eyebrow">Products</span><h2>Pick a product. Go straight to the data.</h2></div>
          <p>Each product has its own interface and data layer. Switch between them below.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="m221-v3-switcher" data-product-switcher>
          <div class="m221-v3-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="M221Tech products">
            <button class="m221-v3-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="panel-m221foot" id="tab-m221foot" data-product="m221foot"><small>Sports</small><strong>M221Foot</strong></button>
            <button class="m221-v3-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-wc2026" id="tab-wc2026" data-product="wc2026"><small>Sports</small><strong>WC2026</strong></button>
            <button class="m221-v3-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-lekkantu" id="tab-lekkantu" data-product="lekkantu"><small>Nutrition</small><strong>Lekkantu</strong></button>
          </div>

          <section class="m221-v3-panel" id="panel-m221foot" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-m221foot" data-product="m221foot">
            <div class="m221-v3-panel-grid">
              <div class="m221-v3-product-copy"><span class="m221-v3-eyebrow">M221Foot</span><h3>Closer to the game.</h3><p>Structured football data for competitions, clubs and matches.</p><div class="m221-v3-tags"><span>Competitions</span><span>Clubs</span><span>Matches</span><span>Lineups</span><span>Events</span></div><div class="m221-v3-product-actions"><a class="m221-v3-product-link m221-v3-product-link-primary" href="https://sports.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open M221Foot ↗</a><a class="m221-v3-product-link" href="/sports/">Product page →</a></div></div>
              <div class="m221-v3-preview" aria-hidden="true"><div class="m221-v3-preview-top"><strong>M221Foot</strong><span>sports.m221.tech</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-nav"><span>Competition</span><span>Club</span><span>Match</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-body"><div class="m221-v3-preview-row"><span class="m221-v3-preview-icon"></span><span><strong>Senegal Ligue 1</strong><small>Competition view</small></span><span>EXPLORE</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-row"><span class="m221-v3-preview-icon"></span><span><strong>Club data</strong><small>Squads · fixtures · context</small></span><span>OPEN</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-row"><span class="m221-v3-preview-icon"></span><span><strong>Match detail</strong><small>Lineups · events · insights</small></span><span>READ</span></div></div></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="m221-v3-panel" id="panel-wc2026" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-wc2026" data-product="wc2026" hidden>
            <div class="m221-v3-panel-grid">
              <div class="m221-v3-product-copy"><span class="m221-v3-eyebrow">WC2026</span><h3>World Cup, our way.</h3><p>A focused event product for following the 2026 World Cup through a Senegalese and African lens.</p><div class="m221-v3-tags"><span>Teams</span><span>Matches</span><span>Players</span><span>Stories</span></div><div class="m221-v3-product-actions"><a class="m221-v3-product-link m221-v3-product-link-primary" href="https://wc2026.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open WC2026 ↗</a><a class="m221-v3-product-link" href="/sports/">Sports page →</a></div></div>
              <div class="m221-v3-preview" aria-hidden="true"><div class="m221-v3-preview-top"><strong>WC2026</strong><span>wc2026.m221.tech</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-nav"><span>Matches</span><span>Teams</span><span>Players</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-body"><div class="m221-v3-preview-row"><span class="m221-v3-preview-icon"></span><span><strong>Tournament view</strong><small>Follow the competition</small></span><span>LIVE</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-row"><span class="m221-v3-preview-icon"></span><span><strong>Senegal focus</strong><small>Context that matters</small></span><span>FOCUS</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-row"><span class="m221-v3-preview-icon"></span><span><strong>African lens</strong><small>More than a generic feed</small></span><span>READ</span></div></div></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="m221-v3-panel" id="panel-lekkantu" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-lekkantu" data-product="lekkantu" hidden>
            <div class="m221-v3-panel-grid">
              <div class="m221-v3-product-copy"><span class="m221-v3-eyebrow">Lekkantu</span><h3>Closer to what people eat.</h3><p>Nutrition data built around products actually found on local shelves.</p><div class="m221-v3-tags"><span>Products</span><span>Ingredients</span><span>Nutrition facts</span><span>Brands</span></div><div class="m221-v3-product-actions"><a class="m221-v3-product-link m221-v3-product-link-primary" href="https://lekkantu.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Lekkantu ↗</a><a class="m221-v3-product-link" href="/nutrition/">Product page →</a></div></div>
              <div class="m221-v3-preview" aria-hidden="true"><div class="m221-v3-preview-top"><strong>Lekkantu</strong><span>lekkantu.com</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-nav"><span>Products</span><span>Ingredients</span><span>Nutrition</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-body"><div class="m221-v3-preview-row"><span class="m221-v3-preview-icon"></span><span><strong>Product profile</strong><small>Label · ingredients · nutrition</small></span><span>READ</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-row"><span class="m221-v3-preview-icon"></span><span><strong>Local shelf</strong><small>Products people actually buy</small></span><span>LOCAL</span></div><div class="m221-v3-preview-row"><span class="m221-v3-preview-icon"></span><span><strong>Food data</strong><small>Structured and searchable</small></span><span>DATA</span></div></div></div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="m221-v3-section">
      <div class="m221-container">
        <div class="m221-v3-section-head"><div><span class="m221-v3-eyebrow">Data layers</span><h2>What we structure.</h2></div><p>The products change. The job stays the same: make useful local data easier to navigate.</p></div>
        <div class="m221-v3-data-grid"><div class="m221-v3-data-card"><small>Football</small><strong>Competitions & matches</strong><span>Results, lineups, events, context</span></div><div class="m221-v3-data-card"><small>Football</small><strong>Clubs & players</strong><span>Squads, appearances, team context</span></div><div class="m221-v3-data-card"><small>Food</small><strong>Products & brands</strong><span>What is actually on the shelf</span></div><div class="m221-v3-data-card"><small>Food</small><strong>Ingredients & nutrition</strong><span>Labels made easier to read</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="m221-v3-section" id="open">
      <div class="m221-container">
        <div class="m221-v3-section-head"><div><span class="m221-v3-eyebrow">Open</span><h2>Use the data. Ask for the analysis.</h2></div></div>
        <div class="m221-v3-open-row"><a class="m221-v3-open-action" href="/open/#data"><div><small>Open Data</small><strong>Browse datasets</strong></div><span>→</span></a><a class="m221-v3-open-action" href="mailto:m221tech@gmail.com?subject=M221Tech%20report%20request"><div><small>Reports</small><strong>Request an analysis</strong></div><span>→</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="m221-v3-section" id="lab">
      <div class="m221-container m221-v3-lab-contact">
        <article class="m221-v3-lab"><span class="m221-pill">From the lab</span><h3>Kurel Facts</h3><p>Culture and local knowledge, explored through data.</p><a href="https://kurel.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Kurel Facts ↗</a></article>
        <article class="m221-v3-contact" id="contact"><span class="m221-v3-eyebrow">Contact</span><h3>Have data worth turning into something useful?</h3><p>Dataset, report, collaboration or idea.</p><a href="mailto:m221tech@gmail.com">m221tech@gmail.com →</a></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    const switchers = document.querySelectorAll('[data-product-switcher]');
    switchers.forEach((switcher) => {
      const tabs = Array.from(switcher.querySelectorAll('[role="tab"]'));
      const panels = Array.from(switcher.querySelectorAll('[role="tabpanel"]'));
      tabs.forEach((tab) => tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const target = tab.getAttribute('aria-controls');
        tabs.forEach((item) => item.setAttribute('aria-selected', item === tab ? 'true' : 'false'));
        panels.forEach((panel) => { panel.hidden = panel.id !== target; });
      }));
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
